{"qid": "76482987", "kind": "freshstack", "language": "python", "title": "Chroma database embeddings = none when using get()", "answer": "The issue is that the embeddings are not being retrieved when using the `get` method. This is because the `get` method only returns the metadata and documents associated with the collection, but not the embeddings. The `query` method, on the other hand, returns the embeddings along with the metadata and documents. You can use the `query` method to retrieve the embeddings, like this: `collection.query(query_embeddings=[[1.2, 2.3, 4.5]], include=['embeddings'])`. This will return a dictionary with the embeddings, like this: `{'ids': [['id1', 'id2']], 'embeddings': [[[1.2, 2.3, 4.5], [6.7, 8.2, 9.2]]], 'documents': None, 'metadatas': None, 'distances': None}`,", "valid_output": true, "insufficient_information": false, "retrieved": ["chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_0_8229", "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/getting-started.md_0_6979", "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/reference/cheatsheet.md_0_6165", "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_8230_10165"], "cited_doc_ids": ["chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/getting-started.md_0_6979", "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/reference/cheatsheet.md_0_6165", "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_0_8229", "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_8230_10165"], "invalid_citations": [], "repaired_citations": [], "degenerate_answer": false, "context_coverage": 0.0, "context_recall": 0.0, "nuggets": ["Embeddings are excluded by default in the `get()` method for performance reasons.", "Use the `include` parameter with the `get()` method to specify that embeddings should be returned.", "To include embeddings in the `get()` method, use `collection.get(include=['embeddings', 'documents', 'metadatas'])`."], "nuggets_present": null, "nugget_judge_ok": null, "citations": [{"doc_id": "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/getting-started.md_0_6979", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": true}, {"doc_id": "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/reference/cheatsheet.md_0_6165", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": true}, {"doc_id": "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_0_8229", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": true}, {"doc_id": "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_8230_10165", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": false}], "generation_s": 49.430434100009734, "judge_s": null, "prompt_tokens": 2832, "output_tokens": 295, "config": {"tokenizer": "identifier_split", "query_mode": "full", "top_k": 4, "max_chars": 2000, "max_tokens": 800, "prompt": "e988f60a3726", "answer_rules": 4, "assistant_llm": {"model": "llama3.2:3b", "digest": "a80c4f17acd55265feec403c7aef86be0c25983ab279d83f3bcd3abbcb5b8b72", "num_ctx": 8192, "temperature": 0.0, "seed": 42}, "judge_llm": null, "judge_version": null, "sample": {"limit": 20, "seed": 42}}}
